title: Measure every executable source and all four coverage dimensions in pm-jira
description: "The current release gate reports 100 percent lines branches functions for index.ts and sdk-importer.ts. It excludes executable scripts, does not measure a fourth statement column, and the documentation gate counts only selected declarations. Existing tests include injected HTTP and process seams. This is not full all-source coverage or exhaustive documentation."
